    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21428" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάκα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδέως</span>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γακεῖαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλυκεῖαι</span>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάκου:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδύ, γλυκύ</span>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γακούδια:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδύσματα</span>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γακουπώνης:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδυπότης</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γᾱκίνας</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], ὁ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>earthquake</i>, Id., <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				890.38
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γᾱκῑνίας</span></b> , ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάκῑνος</span></b> , ὁ, 
				Att.
			 acc. to <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				219.41
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γακτός:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλάσμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝακ-</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝάγ-νυμι</span>).</div>
